comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-27T16:25:47.755Z","harness:codex","Start: build a versioned, SDK-owned multi-step agent transcript contract and upgrade the existing token gate to measure complete tasks, recovery retries, output-envelope conformance, and ratcheted bytes/tokens. This is one connected delivery with pm-f05lsg, pm-srns, pm-k23c4c, and pm-fo8g7j."
  "2026-08-27T17:34:22.018Z","harness:codex","Completion evidence: shipped a public SDK-owned versioned transcript parser plus a four-task, eleven-step corpus covering context bootstrap, closed-domain refusal recovery, unknown-option correction, and lifecycle mutation. The mandatory static gate replays independent accounting-off/accounting-on workspaces, verifies output envelopes, exact shell-free retries, mutation receipts, per-step and completed-task ceilings, corpus identity, and a seeded million-token negative control. Final local verification passed 585 files and 8,062 tests at exact 100/100/100/100; all three linked tests passed with sandboxed PM contexts; the gate reports 3,935 composite tokens. Packed npx, packed bunx, and the 88-command dogfood workflow passed."
  "2026-08-27T17:46:08.995Z","harness:codex","Pre-PR documentation verification: corrected tracker links in docs/OUTPUT_TOKEN_ACCOUNTING.md to the canonical feature and issue directories; all five referenced .toon targets now exist in the repository."
  "2026-08-27T20:37:18.646Z","harness:codex","Review correction scope: exact-head findings are governed by pm-wa39rl and pm-ok2kdn; the gate now requires terminal success, executable unknown-option recovery, refusal-metadata exclusivity, and exact self-reported token estimates."
  "2026-08-27T21:13:31.125Z","harness:codex","Corrective pre-close evidence 2026-08-27: pm test pm-8pnj --run --progress passed all 7 linked commands. Results include transcript/parser tests, canonical 4,349-token replay, release automation contracts, exact 100/100/100/100 coverage over 8,067 tests, packed npx smoke for 13 packages, packed bunx contracts execution, and an 88-command temporary-directory package-first dogfood run. Evidence is appended after reopening and before the next close/release; prior history remains immutable."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-27T17:34:22.496Z","harness:codex","Completed-task token budgets are trustworthy only when corpus identity, task and step identities, independent transport bytes, self-reported accounting, executable recovery, and a seeded regression are all checked together."
